cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "PackScope: Supermarket Packaging Dataset"
version: "1.0"
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/ReignDeve/FanDat"
abstract: >-
  PackScope is a small, student-created image dataset of 33 photographs of
  supermarket product packaging taken in German supermarkets. Each image shows
  one main package, annotated with a bounding box in YOLO format and one of
  nine packaging-type classes (can, bag, box, jar, carton, bottle, tub, tube,
  wrapper), and is described by 16 structured metadata fields (product, brand,
  category, material, quantity, photographer, annotator, capture details).
  It was created for a university course on research data management.
keywords:
  - dataset
  - object detection
  - bounding box
  - YOLO
  - packaging
  - supermarket
  - FAIR
authors:
  # Names taken from metadata.csv (photographer/annotator).
